name=Dan's Traits
id=DanTraits
description=Realistic, balanced traits, mostly negative, that add complications to work around: Dependent, Brittle, Fumbler, Jinxed, Major Depressive Disorder, A Really Bad Day, Hallucinations, Brittle Asthma, Gluten Intolerance, Vegetarian, Diabetes Type 1 and Type 2, plus the positive Renaissance Faire Geek and Gym Regular, and Vitality: fresh food, exercise and sleep slowly earn small stat boosts, junk and neglect the reverse, and the conditions above get milder or harsher with it (rescue inhaler, insulin pen, glucose meter, test strips and metformin items in the loot pool; the airway irritation moodle needs Moodle Framework).
